[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  For pace: R01 to R04 all finished today. R05 and R08 are the heavy ones. R07 is the one most likely to need engine\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchanges,\u001b[12Gbecause\u001b[20Gnothing\u001b[28Ghas\u001b[32Gbeen\u001b[37Gshipped\u001b[45Goutside\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Gdev\u001b[61Genvironment\u001b[73Gyet.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOutside that count:\u001b[41G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mEncryption\u001b[22m (the engine roadmap's open delivery) is only required before Manifest is hosted outside a trusted\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gnetwork. That's L01 territo\u001b[33Gy, not R09.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mW22\u001b[22m (drives past the torch) is parked until the first larger hull a player can fly arrives.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAfter the first draft:\u001b[22m about 34 later workstreams (L01 to L34, minus\u001b[74Gthe three already done,\u001b[98Gplus\u001b[103Gthe\u001b[107GL17\u001b[111Gstretch\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ggoal).\u001b[12GT\u001b[15Gy cover deployment hardening,\u001b[45Gbribery,\u001b[54Gport\u001b[59Gconstruction,\u001b[73Gstargates,\u001b[84Gthe\u001b[88Ggraphical\u001b[98Gclient\u001b[105G(L15),\u001b[112Gmarket\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  services, debt, the power grid and more. Most still need design decisions before anyone builds them, so they're a\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gbacklog rather than a\u001b[27Gsch\u001b[31Gdule.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI read only the delivery order's task table and its \"later priorities\" header, not each task's plan. The engine work\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcolumn\u001b[10Gis a guess.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GWorked for 24s · done 2:12 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mGreat, start on R05\u001b[39m                                                                                                   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✶\u001b[3GFiddle-faddling… \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Use git worktrees to run multiple Claude sessions in parallel.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
