[0.078, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Gservices, debt, the power grid and more. Most still need design decisions before anyone builds them, so they're a\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbacklog rather than a sch\u001b[31Gdule.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gread \u001b[11Gnly \u001b[18G delivery order's task\u001b[41Gtable\u001b[47Gand\u001b[51Gits\u001b[55G\"later\u001b[62Gpriorities\"\u001b[74Gheader,\u001b[82Gnot\u001b[86Geach\u001b[91Gtask's\u001b[98Gplan.\u001b[104GThe\u001b[108Gengine\u001b[115Gwork\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcolumn\u001b[10Gis\u001b[13Ga\u001b[15Gguess.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GWorked for 24s · done 2:12 pm\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mGreat, start on R05\u001b[39m                                                                                                   \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m10\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThe backlog can wait until after we play with the first loop for a day or two.\u001b[39m                                        \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Reading Manifest's journal and server code to build R05 on, then I'll write it. Noted that the L-backlog waits until\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Byou've\u001b[10Gplayed\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gfirst\u001b[27Gloop\u001b[32Gfor\u001b[36Ga\u001b[38Gday\u001b[42Gor\u001b[45Gtwo.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m files…\u001b[K\r\u001b[20C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1m 44s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m8.6k \u001b[38Goke\u001b[42Gs\u001b[44G· thought for 45s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[7B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 ag