[0.013, "o", "\u001b[H \u001b[3G  backlog rather than a schedule.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  I read only the delivery order's task table and its \"later priorities\" header, not each task's plan. The engine work\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcolumn is\u001b[13Ga gue\u001b[19Gs.\u001b[22G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GWorked for 24s · done 2:12 pm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mGreat, start on R05\u001b[39m                                                                                                   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m10\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThe backlog can wait until after we play with the first loop for a day or two.\u001b[39m                                        \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading Manifest's journal\u001b[30Gand\u001b[34Gserver\u001b[41Gcode\u001b[46Gto\u001b[49Gbuild\u001b[55GR05\u001b[59Gon,\u001b[63Gthen\u001b[68GI'll\u001b[73Gwrite\u001b[79Git.\u001b[83GNoted\u001b[89Gthat\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98GL-backlog\u001b[108Gwaits\u001b[114Guntil\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Byou've played the first loop for a day or two.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching\u001b[13Gfor\u001b[17G\u001b[1m2\u001b[19G\u001b[22mpatterns,\u001b[29Greading\u001b[37G\u001b[1m6\u001b[39G\u001b[22mfiles…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  ~/projects/manifest/source/test/CMakeLists.txt\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;193;7m\u001b[1m*\u001b[3G\u001b[22mFiddle-faddling… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(3m 43s · ↓\u001b[32G17.6k tokens · \u001b[38;2;255;193;7mdeep in thought with high effort\u001b[38;