[0.255, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[1mTes\u001b[7Gs:\u001b[22m the host suite covers the stop, b\u001b[44Gckup rete\u001b[54Gtion and\u001b[63Gan interrupted backup, restore and i\u001b[100Gs refusals,\u001b[112Gthe size\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blimit,\u001b[10Gand a backup directory inside th\u001b[43G w\u001b[47Gld. A n\u001b[55Gw t\u001b[59Ga\u001b[61Ging-fixture case back\u001b[83G u\u001b[86G a world\u001b[95Gmid-flight\u001b[106Gwith\u001b[111Ga\u001b[113Gbuy\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Border\u001b[9Gholding\u001b[17Gescrow.\u001b[25GIt\u001b[28Grestores\u001b[37Git,\u001b[41Gchecks\u001b[48Gevery\u001b[54Grequest\u001b[62Goutcome\u001b[70Gmatches,\u001b[79Gand\u001b[83Gflies\u001b[89Gon\u001b[92Gto\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99Gloop's\u001b[106Gusual\u001b[112Gend\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bstate.\u001b[10G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcli_serve\u001b[39m now resto\u001b[30Ges the stop's backup at \u001b[55Ghe step\u001b[63Gthe server stopped, and checks\u001b[94Gthat restoring over a\u001b[116Gl\u001b[118Gv\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bworld is refused.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMeasured in Debug:\u001b[22m a\u001b[24Gbackup is 730 KB today. A restor\u001b[58Gtakes 0.25 s, 0.11 s of which is start-up.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat a backup can lose:\u001b[27G\u001b[22mit\u001b[30Gis\u001b[33Gonly\u001b[38Gas\u001b[41Gfresh\u001b[47Gas\u001b[50Gits\u001b[54Gsnapshot,\u001b[64Gso\u001b[67Gup\u001b[70Gto\u001b[73Gan\u001b[76Ghour\u001b[81Gbehind\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Glive\u001b[97Gworld.\u001b[104GThat's\u001b[111Grecorded\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bin the Stage 5 plan.\u001b[24G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mJet\u001b[7Gison (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mb475aac\u001b[39m):\u001b[22m the\u001b[27Groadmap and history\u001b[47Grecord\u001b[54GR05 as done,\u001b[67GR06 as \u001b[75Gext, and that the later workstream\u001b[111Gwait until\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Byou'v\u001b[10Gpl\u001b[13Gy\u001b[15Gd the first\u001b[27Gloop\u001b[32G