[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  \u001b[1mTests:\u001b[22m the host suite covers the stop, backup retention and an interrupted backup, restore and its refusals, the size\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blimit, and\u001b[14Ga backup directory inside the\u001b[44Gworld. A\u001b[53Gnew tradi\u001b[63Gg-fixture case b\u001b[80Gcks up a\u001b[89Gworld mid-flight with a buy\u001b[117G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bor\u001b[6Ge\u001b[8G holding escrow. It r\u001b[30Gs\u001b[32Gores it, checks\u001b[48Gev\u001b[51Gry r\u001b[56Gquest\u001b[62Goutcome\u001b[70Gmatch\u001b[76Gs, and flies\u001b[89Go\u001b[91G to the loop's usual\u001b[112Gend\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bstate. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcli_serve\u001b[39m now restores the stop's backup\u001b[51Gat the step the\u001b[67Gserver stopped, and ch\u001b[90Gcks that restoring\u001b[109Gover\u001b[114Ga\u001b[116Glive\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bworld is refused.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMeasured in Debug:\u001b[22m a backup is 730 KB today.\u001b[48GA restore\u001b[58Gtakes 0.25\u001b[69Gs, 0.11 \u001b[80Gf which is\u001b[91Gstart-up.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat a backup can lose:\u001b[22m it \u001b[31Gs only as fresh as its snapshot, so up to \u001b[74Gn hour behind the\u001b[92Glive\u001b[97Gworld.\u001b[104GThat's\u001b[111Grecorded\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bin\u001b[6Gthe\u001b[10GStage\u001b[16G5\u001b[18Gplan.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mJettison (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mb475aac\u001b[39m):\u001b[23G\u001b[22mthe roadmap an\u001b[38G history record R05 as done, R06 as next, and\u001b[84Gthat\u001b[89Gthe later works\u001b[105Greams\u001b[111Gwait until\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Byou've p\u001b[12Gayed\u001b[17Gthe first loop for a day or two. That not\u001b[59G is als\u001b[67G in Manifest's session handoff.\u001b[99G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext:\u001b[9G\u001b[22mR06, the runtime\u001b[26Gdistribution\u