153;153;153mcompiled into it, writes its log to ./build/, and links libvulkan.so.1 through the engine's imgui target even \u001b[117G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthough it never draws anything. → Ship it (Recommended)\r\u001b[17C\u001b[8B (shift+tab to cycle) · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
