[0.116, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI\u001b[5Ghave\u001b[10Gwhat\u001b[15GR06\u001b[19Gneeds.\u001b[26GThe\u001b[30Gone\u001b[34Greal\u001b[39Gchoice\u001b[46Gis\u001b[49Gwhich\u001b[55Gruntime\u001b[63Gcontract\u001b[72Gto\u001b[75Gsupport,\u001b[84Gso\u001b[87GI'm\u001b[91Gasking\u001b[98Gyou\u001b[102Gbefore\u001b[109GI\u001b[111Gwrite\u001b[117Git\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gup.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's\u001b[21Gquestions:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · Which runtime distribution should R06 commit Manifest to? Today the release binaries take their interpreter and \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRUNPATH\u001b[14Gfrom the devenv shell's Nix\u001b[42Gstore paths, and they need glibc symbol\u001b[82G up to 2.43, b\u001b[97Gcause n\u001b[105Gxpkgs' glibc is \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B2.44. →\u001b[14GStandalone bu\u001b[28Gdle (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· Should \u001b[16Ghe TUI clie\u001b[28Gt be part of the distribution? Right now it reads its content from a source-tree path \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bcompile\u001b[15Ginto it, writes its log to ./bu\u001b[47Gld/, and links libvulkan.so.1 through \u001b[86Ghe engine's imgui \u001b[105Garget even \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bthough it \u001b[17Gever draws anything. → Ship it (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mGoing\u001b[9Gwith\u001b[14Ga\u001b[16Gstandalone\u001b[27Gbundle,\u001b[35GTUI\u001b[39Gincluded.\u001b[49GNow\u001b[53Gchecking\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Gtoken\u001b[72GCLI\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Glogging\u001b[88Gpaths,\u001b[95Gplus\u001b[100Ghow\u001b[104Gthe\u001b[108Gdocs\u001b[113Grecord\u001b[120Ga\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gfinished task.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m9\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Writing the R06 contract into Manifest's docs, and the engine gap into\u001b[74GJettison's\u001b[85Groadmap.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
