01b[1mDefaults I chose, which you may want to change:\u001b[22m the paths, and b\u001b[70Gckups sw\u001b[79Gtched\u001b[85Gon by default. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--scenario\u001b[111G\u001b[39mstays\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Grequired.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe engine gap:\u001b[19G\u001b[22mJettison's\u001b[30G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mimgui\u001b[36G\u001b[39mtarget\u001b[43Gbuilds\u001b[50GImGui's\u001b[58GGLFW\u001b[63Gand\u001b[67GVulkan\u001b[74Gbackends\u001b[83Ginto\u001b[88Gitself.\u001b[96GSo\u001b[99Ganything\u001b[108Gthat\u001b[113Glinks\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDevtools\u001b[39m, including Manifest's terminal\u001b[43GTUI, needs \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlibvulkan.so.1\u001b[39m eve\u001b[74Gthough it \u001b[85Gever draws. I\u001b[100Gdded a row for this\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto the roadmap's delivery table, to be done before\u001b[54GR07. Manifest has its \u001b[77Gwn f\u001b[82Gxes fo\u001b[90GR07 too:\u001b[99Gthe TUI\u001b[108Geads a\u001b[115G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bc\u001b[5Gn\u001b[7Gent p\u001b[13Gth compiled into it and writes its log to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m./build/\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mFiles changed:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- Manifest: \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mstage-5-recovery-plan.md\u001b[39m,\u001b[41G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdecision-ledger.md\u001b[39m,\u001b[61G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdelivery-order.md\u001b[39m,\u001b[80G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mhistory.md\u001b[39m,\u001b[92G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msession-handoff.md\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BJettison\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/roadmap.md\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/history.md\u001b[76G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
