[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  │ NixOS             │ unstable (2.44)                        │ 26.05 (2.42)                            │\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B├───────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B│ RHEL, Alma, Rocky │ none    \u001b[34G     \u001b[40G    \u001b[45G  \u001b[48G      \u001b[55G     \u001b[61G   │\u001b[66G9 (2.34); 10 isn't\u001b[85Gon Repology  \u001b[99G       │\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B├───────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B│\u001b[5GVoid\u001b[23G│\u001b[25Gnone\u001b[64G│\u001b[66G2.41\u001b[106G│\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B└\u001b[23G┴\u001b[64G┴\u001b[106G┘\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe 2.43 floor rules out Debian stable, Ubuntu 24.04 LTS, every RHEL-family release, Leap and NixOS stable.\u001b[111GMost\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bservers run\u001b[15Gone\u001b[19Gof\u001b[22Gthose\u001b[28G If the bundle\u001b[43Ghas to reach\u001b[56Gthem,\u001b[62GR07\u001b[66Ghas to build against an\u001b[90Golder glibc,\u001b[103Gwhich\u001b[109Gtakes\u001b[115Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bseparate sysroot or toolchain, not just a link flag. That's a change to D-114, and I haven't made it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BMint, Pop!_OS, elementary and SteamOS aren't on Repology, and the Ubuntu 22.04–25.10, Tumbleweed and Void\u001b[109Gfigures\u001b[117Gcome\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfrom a summary\u001b[18Gof\u001b[21Gthe\u001b[25Gpage rather than its raw rows. Mint and Pop!_OS\u001b[73Gfollow thei\u001b[85G Ubuntu LTS b\u001b[99Gse, so\u001b[106Gthey're\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprobably on 2.39 or older until they move to 26.04.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 2m 52s · done 3:04 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThose are pretty modern disto releases, what compromises do we need to make to get it working on ubuntu 24.04 and \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mdebian trixie?\u001b[39m                                                                                                        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3GCrun\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mchi\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mng… \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0024 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
