[0.062, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3GThe\u001b[7G2.43\u001b[12Gfloor\u001b[18Grules\u001b[24Gout\u001b[28GDebian\u001b[35Gstable,\u001b[43GUbuntu\u001b[50G24.04\u001b[56GLTS,\u001b[61Gevery\u001b[67GRHEL-family\u001b[79Grelease,\u001b[88GLeap\u001b[93Gand\u001b[97GNixOS\u001b[103Gstable.\u001b[111GMost\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bservers run \u001b[16Gne of th\u001b[25Gse. If the bundle\u001b[43Ghas \u001b[48Go\u001b[50Greach\u001b[56Gthem, R07 has to bu\u001b[77Gd\u001b[79Gagain\u001b[85Gt an older gl\u001b[99Gbc,\u001b[103Gwhich take\u001b[114G a\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bparate sysroot or t\u001b[25Golchain, not just\u001b[43Ga link\u001b[50Gfl\u001b[53Gg.\u001b[56GT\u001b[58Gat's a c\u001b[68Gnge to D-114, a\u001b[84Gd I haven't\u001b[96Gmade it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BMint,\u001b[9GPop!_OS,\u001b[18Gelementary\u001b[29Gand\u001b[33GSteamOS\u001b[41Garen't\u001b[48Gon\u001b[51GRepology,\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69GUbuntu\u001b[76G22.04–25.10,\u001b[89GTumbleweed\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104GVoid\u001b[109Gfigures\u001b[117Gcome\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfrom a summary\u001b[18Gof the page rather than its raw rows. Mint\u001b[65GPop!_OS follow their Ubuntu LTS base, so they're\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bp\u001b[6Gbably on 2.39 or older until they move to 26.04.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 2m 52s · done 3:04 pm\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThose are pretty modern disto releases, what compromises do we need to make to get it working on ubuntu 24.04 and \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mdebian trixi\u001b[16G?\u001b[39m                                                                                                    \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mChecking\u001b[12Gwhich\u001b[18Gglibc\u001b[24Gsymbols\u001b[32Gnewer\u001b[38Gthan\u001b[4