[0.111, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNext\u001b[8Gis Jetti\u001b[17Gon's ImGui\u001b[28Gsplit:\u001b[35Gmoving\u001b[42GImGui's\u001b[50GGLFW\u001b[55Gand\u001b[59GVulkan\u001b[66Gbackends\u001b[75Gout\u001b[79Gof\u001b[82G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDevtools\u001b[39m,\u001b[92Gso\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99GTUI\u001b[103Gstops\u001b[109Glinking\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BVulkan.\u001b[11GManifest's\u001b[22GR07\u001b[26Gcomes\u001b[32Gafter\u001b[38Git.\u001b[42GOpus\u001b[47Gat\u001b[50Gmedium\u001b[57Geffort\u001b[64Gsuits\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Gsplit.\u001b[81GThis\u001b[86Gis\u001b[89Ga\u001b[91Ggood\u001b[96Gpoint\u001b[102Gto\u001b[105Gstart\u001b[111Ga\u001b[113Gnew\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bs\u001b[5Gssion\u001b[11Gor \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 28s · done 3:13 pm\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mgive me a handoff prompt\u001b[39m                                                                                              \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Paste this into a new session started in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/home/ivan/projects/jettison\u001b[39m:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mImplement the roadmap row \"ImGui's backends out of `Devtool\u001b[63G`\" (docs/roadmap.md, delivery table,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbefore Manifest's R07). Read AGENTS.md, docs/coding-standards.md and docs/game-integration.md first;\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe Manifest side is ../manifest/docs/stage-5-recovery-plan.md, \"The \u001b[73Guntime distribution\u001b[93Gcontract\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(R06)\", section \"What it leaves each task\".\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe gap: the `imgui` target (source/external/CMakeLists.txt, about lines 178-197) compiles ImGui's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BGLFW and Vulkan backends into itself and links both publicly. So anything that links\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B`J\u001b[6Gttison::Devtools\u001b[24G(source/engin\u001b[39Gui/imgui\u001b[62G)\u001b[64Ggets libvulkan.so.1 and l\u001b[90Gbglfw in\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mNEEDED. One of those is Ma\u001b[30Gifes\u001b[35G's terminal TUI, w\u001b[54Gich never draws.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
