[0.440, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mPaste this into a new session started\u001b[41Gin\u001b[44G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/home/ivan/projects/jettison\u001b[39m:\r\u001b[2B  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mImplement the roadmap row \"ImGui's backends out of `Devtools`\" (docs/roadmap.md, delivery table,\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbefore Manifest's R07). Read AGENTS.md, docs/coding-standards.md and docs/game-integration.md first;\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mthe Manifest side is ../manifest/docs/stage-5-recovery-plan.md, \"The runtime distribution contract\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(R06)\", section \"What it leaves each task\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe gap: the `imgui` targ\u001b[29Gt (source/external\u001b[48GCMakeLi\u001b[57Gs.txt, about lines 178-197) compiles ImGu\u001b[99G'\u001b[101G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mGLFW \u001b[10Gd Vulkan backends i\u001b[30Gto i\u001b[35Gself and links both publicly. So anythi\u001b[75Gg that links\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m`Jettison::Devtools` (source/\u001b[33Gngine/ui/imgui/CMakeLists.txt) gets libvulkan.so.1 and libglfw in\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNEEDED. One of those is Manifest's terminal TUI, which never draws.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe change: \u001b[16Geep ImGui'\u001b[28Gcore\u001b[34Gn `imgui`, a\u001b[47Gd move the GLFW and Vulkan backends \u001b[85Gto a separate\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget. Only the render/app side that draws ImGui l\u001b[55Gnk\u001b[58G \u001b[60Ghat\u001b[64Gtarget. Find every co\u001b[86Gsumer o\u001b[94G the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbackends (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*, ImGui_ImplVulkan_*) with clangd or rg, and link each one to the new\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget explicitly. Don't add options or abstractions.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K