ne has no libvulkan or libglfw among its NEEDED\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m(read\u001b[11Glf -d) and starts with \u001b[35Go Vulkan \u001b[45Goader present.\u001b[60GAdd it \u001b[68Gs\u001b[70Ga test or fixture in\u001b[91Gan\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mindep\u001b[11Gndent engine con\u001b[28Gumer,\u001b[36Gt Manifest.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Manif\u001b[11Gst: \u001b[16Gh\u001b[18G staged manifest_tui pass\u001b[45G the same check. After the engine commit, re-pin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m's SDK \u001b[21Go it\u001b[26Gand v\u001b[32Grify there. Manife\u001b[51Gt's\u001b[55Gown R07 work\u001b[68Gstays out of scope.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.250, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbefore Manif\u001b[16Gst's R07). Read AGENTS.md, docs/coding-standards.md and d\u001b[74Gcs/game-int\u001b[86Ggration.md first;\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe Manifest \u001b[17Gide\u001b[21Gis .\u001b[26G/manifest/docs/stage-5-recovery-pl\u001b[61Gn.md, \"The\u001b[72Gruntime distribution contract\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m(R06)\", s\u001b[13Gc\u001b[15Gion \"What it leav\u001b[34G each task\".\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe gap: the `imgui` target (source/external/CMakeLists.txt, about lines 178-197) compiles ImGui's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BGLFW \u001b[9Gnd\u001b[12GVulkan backends into itself and links both publicly. S\u001b[67G anything that links\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m`Jettison::Devtools` (source/engine/ui/imgui/CMakeLists.txt) gets libvulkan.so.1 and libglfw in\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNEEDED. One of tho\u001b[22Ge\u001b[24Gi\u001b[26G Manif\u001b[33Gst's term\u001b[43Gnal TUI, wh\u001b[55Gch never\u001b[64Gdraws.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe change: keep ImGui's core in `imgui`, and move the GLFW and Vulkan backends into a separate\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget. Only the\u001b[20Grender/app side\u001b[36Gthat draws ImGui links that target. Find every\u001b[83Gconsumer of th\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bb\u001b[5Gck\u001b[8Gnds (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*,\u001b[31GImGui_ImplVulkan_*) with clangd or \u001b[68G, and link \u001b[80Gach \u001b[86Ge to the\u001b[95Gnew\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[5Grg\u001b[8Gt explicitly. Don't add opt\u001b[36Gons or abstractions.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAcceptance:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Engine: an executable that links Devtools alone has no libvulkan or libglfw among its NEEDED\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m(read\u001b[11Glf -d) and starts with \u001b[35Go Vulkan \u001b[45Goader present.\u001b[60GAdd it \u001b[68Gs\u001b[70Ga test or fixture in\u001b[91Gan\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mindep\u001b[11Gndent engine con\u001b[28Gumer,\u001b[36Gt Manifest.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Manif\u001b[11Gst: \u001b[16Gh\u001b[18G staged manifest_tui pass\u001b[45G the same check. After the engine commit, re-pin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m's SDK \u001b[21Go it\u001b[26Gand v\u001b[32Grify there. Manife\u001b[51Gt's\u001b[55Gown R07 work\u001b[68Gstays out of scope.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- The gate is green: ./scripts/ci.s\u001b[39G --werror --asan --log build/gate.l\u001b[75Gg,\u001b[78Grun as a background\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.149, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m(R06)\", section \"What it leaves each task\".\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe gap: the `imgui` target (source/external/CMakeLists.txt, about lines 178-197) compiles ImGui's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BGLFW and Vulkan backends into itself and links both publicly. So anything that links\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B`J\u001b[6Gttison::Devtools\u001b[24G(source/engin\u001b[39Gui/imgui\u001b[62G)\u001b[64Ggets libvulkan.so.1 and l\u001b[90Gbglfw in\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mNEEDED. One of those is Ma\u001b[30Gifes\u001b[35G's terminal TUI, w\u001b[54Gich never draws.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe change:\u001b[15Gkeep ImGu\u001b[25G's core in `imgui`, and move the\u001b[58GGLFW and Vulkan backends into a separate\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget. Only the render/app side that draws ImGui links that target. Find every consumer of the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbackends (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*, ImGui_I\u001b[39GplVulk\u001b[47G_*) with clangd\u001b[63Gor rg, and\u001b[74Glin\u001b[78G each one\u001b[88Gto the new\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B exp\u001b[14Gicitly. Don't add options or \u001b[44Gb\u001b[46Gtract\u001b[52Gons.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAccep\u001b[9Gance:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Engine: an executable that links Devtools alone has no libvulkan or libglfw among its NEEDED\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m(readelf -d) and starts with no Vulkan loader present. Add it as a test or fixture in an\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mi\u001b[7Gdep\u001b[11Gnde\u001b[15Gt engine consumer, \u001b[35Got\u001b[38GManifest.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Manif\u001b[11Gst: the staged manifest_tui passes th\u001b[49G sam\u001b[54G check. After the\u001b[72Gengine commit, re-pi\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BManif\u001b[11Gst's SDK to it and verify there. Manifest's own R07 work stays out of scope.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe gate is green: ./scr\u001b[30Gpt\u001b[33G/ci.sh --w\u001b[44Grror --\u001b[52Gsan --log\u001b[62Gbuild/gate.log, run as a\u001b[87Gbackground\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[7Gsk, after reading MemAvailable.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
