[0.738, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m`Jettison::Devtools` (source/\u001b[33Gngine/ui/imgui/CMakeLists.txt) gets libvulkan.so.1 and libglfw in\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNEEDED. One of those is Manifest's terminal TUI, which never draws.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe change: \u001b[16Geep ImGui'\u001b[28Gcore\u001b[34Gn `imgui`, a\u001b[47Gd move the GLFW and Vulkan backends \u001b[85Gto a separate\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget. Only the render/app side that draws ImGui l\u001b[55Gnk\u001b[58G \u001b[60Ghat\u001b[64Gtarget. Find every co\u001b[86Gsumer o\u001b[94G the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbackends (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*, ImGui_ImplVulkan_*) with clangd or rg, and link each one to the new\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget explicitly. Don't add options or abstractions.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAccep\u001b[9Gance:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Engine: an executab\u001b[25Ge that links Devtools alone has no libvulkan\u001b[70Gor libglfw among i\u001b[89Gs\u001b[91GNEEDED\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m(r\u001b[8Gad\u001b[11Glf -d) and\u001b[22Gstar\u001b[27Gs with no Vulkan loader pre\u001b[55Gent. Add it as a test or fixture in an\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bindependent engine consumer, not Manifest.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Manifest\u001b[14G the staged manifest_tui passes the same check. After the engine commit, re-pin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mMan\u001b[9Gf\u001b[11Gst's\u001b[16GSDK to it and ver\u001b[34Gfy th\u001b[40Gre. Manifest's ow\u001b[58G R07 wor\u001b[67G stays out of\u001b[81Gsc\u001b[84Gpe.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Th\u001b[8G gate\u001b[14Gis green: ./scrip\u001b[32Gs/ci.sh --werror --asan --log bu\u001b[65Gld/gate.log, \u001b[79Gun as a background\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btask, after\u001b[17Greading MemAvailable.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mUpd\u001b[7Gte the roadmap row\u001b[26G(done, the\u001b[37Gdate, wh\u001b[46Gt wa\u001b[51G built,\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gexit\u001b[68Gcriterion\u001b[78Gas\u001b[81Gmet) and\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdocs/his\u001b[12Gory.md in the \u001b[27Game comm\u001b[36Gt. Then Manifest's pin bump, its delivery-order and handoff\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mno\u001b[6Ge\u001b[8G, and its history line. Commit and push only when I ask.\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
