[0.130, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mNEEDED. One of tho\u001b[22Ge\u001b[24Gi\u001b[26G Manif\u001b[33Gst's term\u001b[43Gnal TUI, wh\u001b[55Gch never\u001b[64Gdraws.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe change: keep ImGui's core in `imgui`, and move the GLFW and Vulkan backends into a separate\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget. Only the\u001b[20Grender/app side\u001b[36Gthat draws ImGui links that target. Find every\u001b[83Gconsumer of th\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bb\u001b[5Gck\u001b[8Gnds (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*,\u001b[31GImGui_ImplVulkan_*) with clangd or \u001b[68G, and link \u001b[80Gach \u001b[86Ge to the\u001b[95Gnew\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[5Grg\u001b[8Gt explicitly. Don't add opt\u001b[36Gons or abstractions.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAcceptance:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Engine: an executable that links Devtools alone has no libvulkan or libglfw among its NEEDED\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m(read\u001b[11Glf -d) and starts with \u001b[35Go Vulkan \u001b[45Goader present.\u001b[60GAdd it \u001b[68Gs\u001b[70Ga test or fixture in\u001b[91Gan\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mindep\u001b[11Gndent engine con\u001b[28Gumer,\u001b[36Gt Manifest.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Manif\u001b[11Gst: \u001b[16Gh\u001b[18G staged manifest_tui pass\u001b[45G the same check. After the engine commit, re-pin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m's SDK \u001b[21Go it\u001b[26Gand v\u001b[32Grify there. Manife\u001b[51Gt's\u001b[55Gown R07 work\u001b[68Gstays out of scope.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- The gate is green: ./scripts/ci.s\u001b[39G --werror --asan --log build/gate.l\u001b[75Gg,\u001b[78Grun as a background\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtask, after\u001b[17Greading MemAvailable.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mUpdate the roadmap row (done, the date, what was built, the exit criterion as met) and\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdocs/history.m\u001b[18G in\u001b[22Gthe\u001b[26Gsame commit. Then M\u001b[46Gnife\u001b[51Gt's pin\u001b[59Gbump, \u001b[67Gs delivery-order and handoff\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bn\u001b[5Gtes, and its h\u001b[20Gstory\u001b[26Glin\u001b[30G. Co\u001b[35Gmit\u001b[39Gand push only when I ask.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gput\u001b[9Gthe\u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mimgui\u001b[19G\u001b[39mtarget\u001b[26Gat\u001b[29Gabout\u001b[35Glines\u001b[41G178–197\u001b[49Gof\u001b[52G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msource/external/CMakeLists.txt\u001b[83G\u001b[39mfrom\u001b[88Gmemory\u001b[95Gof\u001b[98Gthe\u001b[102Gearlier\u001b[110Gsession.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.099, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtarget\u001b[13Gly the render/app side that draws\u001b[47GImGui l\u001b[55Gnks that\u001b[64Gtarget. Find every consumer of the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbackends (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*, ImGui_ImplVulkan_*) with clangd or rg, and link each one to the new\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget explicitly. Don\u001b[26Gt\u001b[28Gadd options or abstractions.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAc\u001b[6Geptance:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Engin\u001b[11G: an executable that\u001b[32Glinks Devtool\u001b[46G alone has no libvulkan or libglfw among its NEEDED\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B(readelf -d) and starts with no Vulkan loader present. Add it as a test or fixture in an\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mindependent engine consumer, not Manifest.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BMan\u001b[9Gf\u001b[11Gst: the staged manifest_tui passes the same check. After the engine com\u001b[83Git,\u001b[87Gre-pin\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mManif\u001b[11Gst's SDK to it and verify\u001b[37Gthere.\u001b[44GManifest's own R07 work \u001b[69Gt\u001b[71Gys out of scope.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- The gate is\u001b[17Ggree\u001b[22G:\u001b[24G./scripts/ci.sh --w\u001b[44Grror --asan --log build/gate.log, run as a background\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mt\u001b[7Gsk, after reading MemAvailable.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mUpdate th\u001b[14Groadmap row (done, the date, what was built, the exit criterion\u001b[78Gas met) and\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/history.md in the same commit\u001b[38G Then Manifest's pin bump, its delivery-order and handoff\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnotes, and its history line. Commit and push only when I ask.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI put the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mimgui\u001b[39m target at about lines 178–197 of \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msource/external/CMakeLists.txt\u001b[39m from memory of\u001b[98Gthe\u001b[102Gearlier\u001b[110Gsession.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe new session should confirm the line numbers before it relies\u001b[68Gon\u001b[71Gthem.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[3GHatching… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(11s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m753 tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
