[0.252, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mNEEDED. One of those is Manifest's terminal TUI, which never draws.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe change: keep\u001b[20GImGui's core in\u001b[36G`imgui`, and move the GLFW and Vulkan backends\u001b[83Ginto a separat\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[5Grg\u001b[8Gt. Only the render/app\u001b[31Gside that draws ImGui links that ta\u001b[68Get. Find ev\u001b[80Gry c\u001b[86Gsumer of\u001b[95Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bb\u001b[5Gck\u001b[8Gnds (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*, ImGu\u001b[36G_ImplVulkan_*) with clangd or rg, and link each one to the new\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget explicitly. Don't add options or abstractions.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAcceptance:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Engin\u001b[11G: an executable that li\u001b[35Gks Devtoo\u001b[45Gs alone has no\u001b[60Glibvulk\u001b[68Gn\u001b[70Gor libglfw among its\u001b[91GNEEDED\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B(read\u001b[11Glf -d) and start\u001b[28G with\u001b[36G Vulkan loader present. Add it as a test or fixture in an\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mindep\u001b[11Gnden\u001b[16G \u001b[18Gngine consumer, not Manif\u001b[45Gt.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- \u001b[13G: the s\u001b[21Gaged\u001b[26Gmanif\u001b[32Gst_tui passes the \u001b[51Game\u001b[55Gcheck. After\u001b[68Gthe engine commit, re-pin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mManifest's SDK to it and verify t\u001b[39Gere. Manifest's own R07 work stays \u001b[75Gut\u001b[78Gof scope.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- The gate is\u001b[17Ggreen: ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan --log build/gate.log, run as a background\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btask, after reading MemAvailable.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mUpdate the roa\