[0.020, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Paste this into a new session started in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/home/ivan/projects/jettison\u001b[39m:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[48;2;38;79;120mImplement the roadmap row \"ImGui's backends out of `Devtools`\" (docs/roadmap.md, delivery table,\u001b[39m                      \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbefore Manifest's R07). Read AGENTS.md, docs/coding-standards.md and docs/game-integration.md first;\u001b[39m                  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mthe Manifest side is ../manifest/docs/stage-5-recovery-plan.md, \"The \u001b[73Guntime distribution\u001b[93Gcontract\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(R06)\", section \"What it leaves each task\".\u001b[39m                                                         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                                  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe gap: the `imgui` target (source/external/CMakeLists.txt, about lines 178-197) compiles ImGui's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BGLFW and Vulkan backends into itself and links both publicly. So anything that links\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B`J\u001b[6Gttison::Devtools\u001b[24G(source/engin\u001b[39Gui/imgui\u001b[62G)\u001b[64Ggets libvulkan.so.1 and l\u001b[90Gbglfw in\u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mNEEDED. One of those is Ma\u001b[30Gifes\u001b[35G's terminal TUI, w\u001b[54Gich never draws.\u001b[39m                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                               \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe change:\u001b[15Gkeep ImGu\u001b[25G's core in `imgui`, and move the\u001b[58GGLFW and Vulkan backends into a separate\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget. Only the render/app side that draws ImGui links that target. Find every consumer of the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbackends (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*, ImGui_I\u001b[39GplVulk\u001b[47G_*) with clangd\u001b[63Gor rg, and\u001b[74Glin\u001b[78G each one\u001b[88Gto the new\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B exp\u001b[14Gicitly. Don't add options or \u001b[44Gb\u001b[46Gtract\u001b[52Gons.\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                               \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAccep\u001b[9Gance:\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Engine: an executable that links Devtools alone has no libvulkan or libglfw among its NEEDED\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m(readelf -d) and starts with no Vulkan loader present. Add it as a test or fixture in an\u001b[39m                            \r\u001b[1B               \u001b[38;2;255;193;7mYou've used 80% of your weekly limit · resets 2am (Australia/Brisbane)\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · try /model sonnet · ~2× runway\u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m────────────────────\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
