[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[48;2;38;79;120mNEEDED. One of those is Ma\u001b[30Gifes\u001b[35G's terminal TUI, w\u001b[54Gich never draws.\u001b[39m                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                               \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThe change:\u001b[15Gkeep ImGu\u001b[25G's core in `imgui`, and move the\u001b[58GGLFW and Vulkan backends into a separate\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget. Only the render/app side that draws ImGui links that target. Find every consumer of the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbackends (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*, ImGui_I\u001b[39GplVulk\u001b[47G_*) with clangd\u001b[63Gor rg, and\u001b[74Glin\u001b[78G each one\u001b[88Gto the new\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B exp\u001b[14Gicitly. Don't add options or \u001b[44Gb\u001b[46Gtract\u001b[52Gons.\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                               \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAccep\u001b[9Gance:\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Engine: an executable that links Devtools alone has no libvulkan or libglfw among its NEEDED\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m(readelf -d) and starts with no Vulkan loader present. Add it as a test or fixture in an\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mi\u001b[7Gdep\u001b[11Gnde\u001b[15Gt engine consumer, \u001b[35Got\u001b[38GManifest.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Manif\u001b[11Gst: the staged manifest_tui passes th\u001b[49G sam\u001b[54G check. After the\u001b[72Gengine commit, re-pi\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BManif\u001b[11Gst's SDK to it and verify there. Manifest's own R07 work stays out of scope.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe gate is green: ./scr\u001b[30Gpt\u001b[33G/ci.sh --w\u001b[44Grror --\u001b[52Gsan --log\u001b[62Gbuild/gate.log, run as a\u001b[87Gbackground\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[7Gsk, after reading MemAvailable.\u001b[39m                                                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mUpd\u001b[7Gte the roadm\u001b[20Gp row (done, the date, what was built, the exit criterion as met) and\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdocs/history.md in the same commit. Then Manifest's pin bump, its delivery-order and handoff\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnotes,\u001b[10Gand\u001b[14Gits history\u001b[26Gline. Commit and\u001b[43Gpush\u001b[48Gonly when I ask.\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                            \u001b[49m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
