[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAcceptance:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Engine: an executab\u001b[25Ge that links Devtools alone has no libvulkan\u001b[70Gor libglfw among i\u001b[89Gs\u001b[91GNEEDED\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m(r\u001b[8Gad\u001b[11Glf -d) and\u001b[22Gstar\u001b[27Gs with no Vulkan loader pre\u001b[55Gent. Add it as a test or fixture in an\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bindependent engine consumer, not Manifest.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Manifest\u001b[14G the staged manifest_tui passes the same check. After the engine commit, re-pin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mMan\u001b[9Gf\u001b[11Gst's\u001b[16GSDK to it and ver\u001b[34Gfy th\u001b[40Gre. Manifest's ow\u001b[58G R07 wor\u001b[67G stays out of\u001b[81Gsc\u001b[84Gpe.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Th\u001b[8G gate\u001b[14Gis green: ./scrip\u001b[32Gs/ci.sh --werror --asan --log bu\u001b[65Gld/gate.log, \u001b[79Gun as a background\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btask, after\u001b[17Greading MemAvailable.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mUpd\u001b[7Gte the roadmap row\u001b[26G(done, the\u001b[37Gdate, wh\u001b[46Gt wa\u001b[51G built,\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gexit\u001b[68Gcriterion\u001b[78Gas\u001b[81Gmet) and\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdocs/his\u001b[12Gory.md in the \u001b[27Game comm\u001b[36Gt. Then Manifest's pin bump, its delivery-order and handoff\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mno\u001b[6Ge\u001b[8G, and its history line. Commit and push only when I ask.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[39mI put the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mimgui\u001b[39m target at about lines 178–197 of \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msource/external/CMak\u001b[73GL\u001b[75Gsts.txt\u001b[39m from memory\u001b[95Gof\u001b[98Gthe\u001b[102Gearlier\u001b[110Gsession.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe new session should confirm the line numbers before it relies on them.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 11s · done 3:16 pm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m/clear\u001b[39m                                                                                                                \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[3GBefudd\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mlin\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mg… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msent 1826 chars via OSC 52 · if past\u001b[40G fails, hold Shift (Option in iTerm2, Fn in Terminal.app) while selecting for …\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
