[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mNEEDED. One of those is Manifest's terminal TUI, which never draws.\u001b[39m                                                   \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThe change: keep ImGui's core in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mimgui\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m, and move the GLFW and Vulkan backends into a separate\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mtarget. Only the render/app side that draws ImGui links that target. Find every consumer of the\u001b[39m                       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mbackends (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*, ImGui_ImplVulkan_*) with clangd or rg, and link each one to the new\u001b[39m                       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mtarget explicitly. Don't add options or abstractions.\u001b[39m                                                                 \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mA\u001b[5Gc\u001b[7Gptance:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- Engine: an executable that links Devtools alone has no libvulkan or libglfw among its NEEDED\u001b[39m                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  (readelf -d) and starts with no Vulkan loader present. Add it as a test or fixture in an\u001b[39m                            \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  independent engine consumer, not Manifest.\u001b[39m                                                                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- Manifest: the staged manifest_tui passes the same check. After the engine commit, re-pin\u001b[39m                            \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  Manifest's SDK to it and verify there. Manifest's own R07 work stays out of scope.\u001b[39m                                  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- The gate is green: ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan --log build/gate.log, run as a background\u001b[39m                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  task, after reading MemAvailable.\u001b[39m                                                                                   \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mUpdate the roadmap row (done, the date, what was built, the exit criterion as met) and\u001b[39m                                \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mdocs/history.md in the same commit. Then Manifest's pin bump, its delivery-order and handoff\u001b[39m                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mnotes, and its history line. Commit and push only when I ask.\u001b[39m                                                         \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[3GHatching… \r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;255;193;7m⏵⏵ auto mode on\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
