[0.023, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThe change:\u001b[15Gkeep ImGu\u001b[25G's core in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mimgui\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m, and\u001b[47Gmove\u001b[52Gt\u001b[54Ge GLFW and Vulkan backends into a separate\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btarget. Only the render/app side that draws ImGui links that target. Find every consumer of the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbackends (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*, ImGui_ImplVulkan_*) with\u001b[56Gclangd or rg, and link each \u001b[85Gne\u001b[88Gto the new\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B exp\u001b[14Gicitly. Don't add options or \u001b[44Gb\u001b[46Gtract\u001b[52Gons.\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                               \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mAccep\u001b[9Gance:\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- Engine: an executable that links Devtools alone has no libvulkan or libglfw among its NEEDED\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  (readelf -d) and starts with no Vulkan loader present. Add it as a test or fixture in an\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gi\u001b[7Gdep\u001b[11Gnde\u001b[15Gt engine consumer, \u001b[35Got\u001b[38GManifest.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m-\u001b[5GManif\u001b[11Gst: the staged manifest_tui passes th\u001b[49G sam\u001b[54G check. After the\u001b[72Gengine commit, re-pi\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BManif\u001b[11Gst's SDK to it and verify there. Manifest's own R07 work stays out of scope.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe gate is green: ./scr\u001b[30Gpt\u001b[33G/ci.sh --w\u001b[44Grror --\u001b[52Gsan --log\u001b[62Gbuild/gate.log, run as a\u001b[87Gbackground\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[7Gsk, after reading MemAvailable.\u001b[39m                                                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mUpd\u001b[7Gte the roadm\u001b[20Gp row (done, the date, what was built, the exit criterion as met) and\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdocs/history.md in the same commit. Then Manifest's pin bump, its delivery-order and handoff\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnotes,\u001b[10Gand\u001b[14Gits history\u001b[26Gline. Commit and\u001b[43Gpush\u001b[48Gonly when I ask.\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[39m Searching for \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m patterns, reading \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.035, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mtarget. Only the\u001b[20Grender/app side\u001b[36Gthat dr\u001b[44Gws\u001b[47GImGui links th\u001b[62Gt target.\u001b[72GFind every c\u001b[85Gnsum\u001b[90Gr of the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bb\u001b[5Gck\u001b[8Gnds (ImGui_ImplGlfw_*,\u001b[31GImGui_ImplVulkan_*) with clangd or \u001b[68G, and link \u001b[80Gach \u001b[86Ge to the\u001b[95Gnew\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[5Grg\u001b[8Gt explicitly. Don't add opt\u001b[36Gons or abstractions.\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mAcceptance:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Engine: an executable that links Devtools alone has no libvulkan or libglfw among its NEEDED\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G(read\u001b[11Glf -d) and starts with \u001b[35Go Vulkan \u001b[45Goader present.\u001b[60GAdd it \u001b[68Gs\u001b[70Ga test or fixture in\u001b[91Gan\u001b[39m    \r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mindep\u001b[11Gndent engine con\u001b[28Gumer,\u001b[36Gt Manifest.\u001b[39m                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m-\u001b[5GManif\u001b[11Gst: \u001b[16Gh\u001b[18G staged manifest_tui pass\u001b[45G the same check. After the engine commit, re-pin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[13G's SDK \u001b[21Go it\u001b[26Gand v\u001b[32Grify there. Manife\u001b[51Gt's\u001b[55Gown R07 work\u001b[68Gstays out of scope.\u001b[39m      \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m-\u001b[5GThe gate is green: ./scripts/ci.s\u001b[39G --werror --asan --log build/gate.l\u001b[75Gg,\u001b[78Grun as a background\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtask, after\u001b[17Greading MemAvailable.\u001b[39m                                                           \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mUpdate the roadmap row (done, the date, what was built, the exit criterion as met) and\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdocs/history.m\u001b[18G in\u001b[22Gthe\u001b[26Gsame commit. Then M\u001b[46Gnife\u001b[51Gt's pin\u001b[59Gbump, \u001b[67Gs delivery-order and handoff\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bn\u001b[5Gtes, and its h\u001b[20Gstory\u001b[26Glin\u001b[30G. Co\u001b[35Gmit\u001b[39Gand push only when I ask.\u001b[39m                               \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching\u001b[13Gfor\u001b[17G\u001b[1m3\u001b[19G\u001b[22mpatterns,\u001b[29Greading\u001b[37G\u001b[1m1\u001b[39G\u001b[22mfile,\u001b[45Grunning\u001b[53G\u001b[1m1\u001b[55G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[61Gcommand…\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m ⎿  $ cat source/engine/ui/imgui/CMakeLists.txt\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
