[0.041, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[9G\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m exp\u001b[14Gicitly. Don't add options or \u001b[44Gb\u001b[46Gtract\u001b[52Gons.\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                               \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mAccep\u001b[9Gance:\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- Engine: an executable that links Devtools alone has no libvulkan or libglfw among its NEEDED\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  (readelf -d) and starts with no Vulkan loader present. Add it as a test or fixture in an\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gi\u001b[7Gdep\u001b[11Gnde\u001b[15Gt engine consumer, \u001b[35Got\u001b[38GManifest.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m-\u001b[5GManif\u001b[11Gst: the staged manifest_tui passes th\u001b[49G sam\u001b[54G check. After the\u001b[72Gengine commit, re-pi\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BManif\u001b[11Gst's SDK to it and verify there. Manifest's own R07 work stays out of scope.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe gate is green: ./scr\u001b[30Gpt\u001b[33G/ci.sh --w\u001b[44Grror --\u001b[52Gsan --log\u001b[62Gbuild/gate.log, run as a\u001b[87Gbackground\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[7Gsk, after reading MemAvailable.\u001b[39m                                                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mUpd\u001b[7Gte the roadm\u001b[20Gp row (done, the date, what was built, the exit criterion as met) and\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdocs/history.md in the same commit. Then Manifest's pin bump, its delivery-order and handoff\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnotes,\u001b[10Gand\u001b[14Gits history\u001b[26Gline. Commit and\u001b[43Gpush\u001b[48Gonly when I ask.\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m11\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m files, listed \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m directories, ran \u001b[1m5\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mR\u001b[6Gding the build fil\u001b[25Gs: the only backend consumer is\u001b[57G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mrender\u001b[39m's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mImGuiRenderer.cpp\u001b[39m. Next I'm checking\u001b[103Gthe\u001b[107Gexport\u001b[114Grules\r\u001b[1B  and how Devtools gets exercised with no renderer.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[3GHatching… \u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 24s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
