mGui's GLFW and Vulkan backends out of \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bimgui, for Manifest's R07\u001b[39m).\u001b[31GAfter\u001b[37Git:\u001b[41GManifest's\u001b[52G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mMANIFEST_JETTISON_REVISION\u001b[79G\u001b[39mbump\u001b[84Gand\u001b[88Ga\u001b[90Gcheck\u001b[96Gon\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103Gpin,\u001b[108Gits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdelivery-order and handoff notes, and its history line.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BI didn't hide the Vulkan load\u001b[33Gr from the system for \u001b[56Ghe\u001b[59G\"starts with no Vulkan loader present\" check. Instead, both\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprograms ran with no loader\u001b[31Gin NEEDED\u001b[41Gand none loaded. Manifest's TUI check\u001b[79Gwas by hand, since adding it\u001b[108Gto Manifest's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bown t\u001b[9Gsts is R07's\u001b[22Gjob.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBaked for 19m 44s · done 3:36 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mgo ahead\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[3GBoogieing… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
