ainst this working tree in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild/sdk-local\u001b[39m. Its NEEDED has no \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlibvulkan\u001b[110G\u001b[39mor\u001b[113G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlibglfw\u001b[39m;\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthe build\u001b[15Gon the current pin \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mea66afe\u001b[39m has \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlibvulkan.so.1\u001b[39m.\u001b[62GRun on a terminal for about ten minutes, it had\u001b[110Gneither\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bloaded.  \u001b[15G  \u001b[18G   \u001b[22G       \u001b[30G   \u001b[34G       \u001b[42G   \u001b[46G \u001b[75G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
