[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe only check on this so far is\u001b[40Gearlier\u001b[48G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest_tui\u001b[39m build against my local Jet\u001b[88Gison tre\u001b[97G, which matches\u001b[113G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249md9f565c\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BManifest's gate\u001b[19Ghasn't\u001b[26Grun\u001b[30Gon\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gfetched\u001b[45Gpin.\u001b[50GEarlier\u001b[58Gpin\u001b[62Gbumps\u001b[68Gwere\u001b[73Gcommitted\u001b[83Gonly\u001b[88Gafter\u001b[94Gthat\u001b[99Ggate\u001b[104Gpassed,\u001b[112Gand\u001b[116Git\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfetches\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15Gengine\u001b[22Gfrom\u001b[27GGitHub,\u001b[35Gso\u001b[38Git\u001b[41Gcan't\u001b[47Grun\u001b[51Guntil\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gcommit\u001b[68Gis\u001b[71Gpushed.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mDecision for you:\u001b[22m may I push Jettison \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m? Then I'll run Manifest's gate on\u001b[88Gthe fe\u001b[95Gched pin\u001b[104Gand commit\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BManif\u001b[10Gt if\u001b[15Git passes. I'd p\u001b[32Gsh\u001b[35GMan\u001b[39Gfest only whe\u001b[53G you ask.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 1m 20s · done 3:38 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
